Package: yamaa
Title: Clinical Data Standardization Using 'YAML' Specifications
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yilong", "Zhang", email = "elong0527@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Ming-Chun", "Chen", role = "ctb"),
    person("Peng", "Zhang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Bingjun", "Wang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Jingwei", "Xiong", role = "ctb"),
    person("The authors of the bundled Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "listed in inst/AUTHORS"),
    person("Evan Miller and the ReadStat authors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "bundled ReadStat C sources, inst/LICENSE-READSTAT.txt"))
Description: Builds standardized clinical trial datasets using 'YAML'
    specifications. Supports the Study Data Tabulation Model (SDTM) and
    Analysis Data Model (ADaM), with specification checks, data derivations,
    and structured diagnostics. Generates submission metadata in
    'Define-XML' format.
